tamber lexy

// Each SF Symbol Lexy uses, with the nearest Material Symbols Rounded glyph
// (@material-symbols/svg-400 0.48.0, Apache-2.0: assets/icons/LICENSE) for the
// hosts that have no SF Symbols, the web and Linux; the chevrons are the
// larger iOS ones at weight 600 (`arrow_back_ios_new`, `arrow_forward_ios`),
// as SF's semibold chevrons, their view boxes cut to 870 so a chevron's ink is
// SF's at the same size (15 px tall at 17). A name with a part that starts
// with a digit is written with underscores.
